# GETTING STARTED

## Prerequisites

```bash
# Ubuntu/Debian
sudo apt-get install build-essential cmake git python3 \
    libvulkan-dev vulkan-tools libglfw3-dev

# Python packages
pip install anthropic torch numpy
```

## Build Instructions

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone <your-repo> drx-engine
cd drx-engine

# Create build directory
mkdir build && cd build

# Configure
cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release

# Build
cmake --build . --parallel 8

# Run editor
./bin/DRXEditor
```

## First AI Prompt

```
In the editor, open AI Assistant panel and type:

"Create a simple FPS game with player movement, shooting, 
and 10 enemies to defeat"

The AI will generate the complete game!
```

